      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（抬头一看，晴空下绽放着樱花。\n但……我的花朵还未绽放。）",
      "source_fingerprint": "502c16e0fd0c9882b6b1c1f672afabeeb090793ca27e5e40a0ed85de4e8edf26",
