    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aa662cdf0b5f42941cb01da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天我一样来到训练赛道，寻找我想签约的赛马娘。\n定睛一看，在训练赛道的角落──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c70be7977a294d3be837b462773ddc21ae9786ee602e60f1de06840b7bafd799",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
