      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊，你是上次那位……训练员吧？\n我叫做西野花。你的伤已经好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ac1bd4afc9ac5653f32925c8c62bf9ba1a4f151aedf920ec5f9929e3ea3e810",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
