    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce75e9f735cd8fbffcb8a11f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……其实是因为我还有很多要学习的地方……那个……\n我怕自己会妨碍到其他同学。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6591e897768b25bdbc13f8060961b1ccd2e536fce7e1b004e65b048f1c8741c",
