      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc16195dec8462a8696944b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西野花这么说道，并露出笑容。\n然后她深深地鞠了一个躬，继续原本的训练。",
